rose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#1-executive-overview--key-focus&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When we began our Saturday sessions, we weren&amp;rsquo;t only thinking about teaching. We wanted to know whether a child who feels safe, curious, and part of a team learns better. Here is what we saw in the first two weeks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
